      "content": "hey so i have stage 3 kidney disease and lately im getting these really bad muscle cramps and feeling super tired all the time... i think my potassium might be low. do you think it would be okay if i started taking some potassium supplements? like if i took a couple of those 99mg ones a few times a day it might help?",
